`ExtractV3StmtAt B` (AIR ⇒ `GoodV3 B`) splits as v1's `ExtractStmt`
(`Near/Extract/Statements.lean`, `Near/Extract/Compose.lean`) into

* the **per-table views** (proved: `ViewsV3.lean`, `ExtractV3.lean:rcptV3_view_nearAir`,
